      "subject": "והיו לו פאת",
      "rationale": "Bafoledi ba fapana: 'mahlakore a wona a bohlaborwa le bodibela' (KJV\/ASV) kgahlanong le 'lewatle le tla ba bohlaborwa bja wona' (ysa ya mo go yona ya pele)."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme ke a maina a dikgoro: go tšwa mafelelong a leboa, go ya letseatleng la tsela ya Hetlone, go tsena go Hamate, go Hatsare-Enane, moedi wa Damaseke ka leboa, go ya letseatleng la Hamate; gomme a tla ba le wona ⟨mahlakoreng⟩ a bohlaborwa le bodibela — Dane, tee.",
